  "text": "beUI Native is free — Pro mobile blocks and screens are in presale from $99\n\nReserve\nbeUI Pro for mobile\nbeUI\nComponents\nBlocks\nAgents\nCharts\nPlayground\nSponsors\nLight theme\nLight theme\nDark theme\nDark theme\nSystem theme\nSystem theme\n1.9k\nGet Pro\n\nINTRO\n\nHome\nCHARTS\n14\nSankey Chart\nNEW\nTreemap\nCandlestick Chart\nDonut Chart\nVolume Profile\nStatus Bar\nComposition Chart\nFunnel Chart\nLiquidity Heatmap\nBump Chart\nOrder Book\nHeat Calendar\nReturns Calendar\nPrice Target Fan\nCharts\nBump Chart\nBump Chart\nCopy Page\n\nAnimated rankings with curved paths, interactive rank dots, and tooltips.\n\nPreview\nPreview\nPreview\nUsage\nUsage\nCode\nCode\nThe leaderboard\n\nFive products. Six months. Every move.\n\nShuffle rankings\nApr\nMay\nJun\nJul\nAug\nSep\nStudio\nCanvas\nLayers\nOrbit\nFrame\n4\n3\n2\n3\n2\n1\n1\n1\n3\n2\n1\n2\n3\n2\n1\n1\n3\n3\n2\n4\n5\n4\n5\n4\n5\n5\n4\n5\n4\n5\nIllustrative product rankings, April to September — exact ranks\nSeries\tApr\tMay\tJun\tJul\tAug\tSep\nStudio\t4\t3\t2\t3\t2\t1\nCanvas\t1\t1\t3\t2\t1\t2\nLayers\t3\t2\t1\t1\t3\t3\nOrbit\t2\t4\t5\t4\t5\t4\nFrame\t5\t5\t4\t5\t4\t5\nStudio\n#1\n↑3\nCanvas\n#2\n↓1\nLayers\n#3\n—\nOrbit\n#4\n↓2\nFrame\n#5\n—\n\nInspect a dot for details · Select to pin a product\n\nInstall\n\nAdd it with the shadcn CLI, or copy the source manually.\n\nCLI\nCLI\nManual\nManual\nbun\nbun\nnpm\nnpm\npnpm\npnpm\nyarn\nyarn\n$ bunx --bun shadcn add @beui/\nbump-chart\nbump-chart\nAPI Reference\nBumpChart\nseries\nreadonly BumpSeries[]\n—\nperiods\nreadonly string[]\n\nUnique period labels, in chronological order.\n\n—\nactive?\nstring | null\n\nPinned series ID. Null clears the selection.\n\n—\ndefaultActive?\nstring | null\n—\nonActiveChange?\n((id: string | null) => void)\n—\nlabel?\nstring\n—\nclassName?\nstring\n—\nBumpChartLegend\nclassName?\nstring\n—\nBumpChartPlot\nclassName?\nstring\n—\nRelated components\nStatus Bar\n\nAnimated status history with rounded bars and period tooltips.\n\nComposition Chart\n\nStacked bar and area shares with period tooltips and a compact interactive legend.\n\nFunnel Chart\n\nVertical and horizontal funnels with curved stages and animated number tooltips.\n\nAbout Bump Chart\n\nBump Chart is a React ranking chart that draws how positions change over time as curved lines between rank dots. Curves, dots and end labels share one set of spring-animated coordinates in Framer Motion, so when rankings update everything moves together. Hovering a series isolates it, rank dots open tooltips with the change from the previous period, and a legend pins a series. Missing periods break the line instead of inventing a rank.\n\nWhen to use it\nA sports or esports page shows league standings week by week.\nA product analytics dashboard tracks how features, pages or apps move in a top ten list over several months.\nA leaderboard or market share report needs to show who climbed and who fell, not just the final order.\nAccessibility\n\nThe chart is an SVG with the img role, a title and a description, followed by a visually hidden table with the exact rank of every series in every period. Each rank dot and legend entry is a button with a descriptive label and a pressed state for the pinned series, and Escape clears the pin. The plot region is focusable so keyboard users can scroll it horizontally. With reduced motion enabled, lines and dots jump to new ranks and skip the reveal, keeping only opacity changes.\n\nFAQ\nHow do I make a bump chart in React?\nPass BumpChart a periods array of labels and a series array where each item has an id, a name, one rank per period and an optional color. Use null for a period with no rank.\nCan I control which series is highlighted?\nYes. Use active with onActiveChange for controlled pinning, or defaultActive to let the chart manage it. Passing null clears the selection.\nCan I rearrange the plot and legend?\nYes. Pass children to BumpChart and place BumpChartPlot and BumpChartLegend wherever you want. The useBumpChart hook reads the shared state from any child.\n\nUpdated Oct 18, 2026\n\nbeUI\nPro\nLimited Offer\n\n300+ blocks and premium motion components for React and Next.js.\n\n$179 lifetime access\n\nExplore beUI Pro\nSponsors\n\nDIAMOND\n\nTracwell\n\nVisitor insights for growth\n\nIllos\n\nAnimated illustrations for product sites\n\nBecome a sponsor",
